1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

PRESEC GHANA is a digital ecosystem designed to connect Presbyterian
Secondary School (PRESEC) branches, students, alumni, teachers, and
administrators across all 16 regions of Ghana.

The platform begins with PRESEC Tema Community 11 as the first
participating school and is architected to expand to every PRESEC
branch nationwide without requiring any rebuilding of the system.

PRESEC GHANA serves as:

     •  A digital home for the PRESEC community
     •  A heritage archive preserving the school's history
     •  A professional network for alumni
     •  A mentorship and opportunity hub
     •  A transparent school development tracker
     •  A reunion and event management platform

The platform will be delivered in ten phases, starting with a public
website and alumni portal, and eventually expanding to include a
mobile application and AI-powered features.

