2. VISION AND MISSION
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

2.1  VISION

To create a unified digital home for the entire PRESEC community that
preserves history, enables connections, creates opportunities, and
supports school development across Ghana.

2.2  MISSION

     •  Connect alumni across generations and geographic locations
     •  Preserve and celebrate PRESEC's heritage
     •  Create economic and mentorship opportunities for members
     •  Support school infrastructure and development
     •  Foster a lifelong PRESEC community

2.3  TAGLINE

     One Community. Many Generations. One Future.

