6. GEOGRAPHIC STRUCTURE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

The platform is built around a hierarchy that allows any PRESEC
branch in Ghana to participate without rebuilding.

    Ghana
      │
      ├── 16 Regions
      │     ├── Greater Accra
      │     ├── Ashanti
      │     ├── Central
      │     ├── Eastern
      │     ├── Western
      │     ├── Western North
      │     ├── Volta
      │     ├── Oti
      │     ├── Northern
      │     ├── Savannah
      │     ├── North East
      │     ├── Upper East
      │     ├── Upper West
      │     ├── Bono
      │     ├── Bono East
      │     └── Ahafo
      │
      └── Districts
            └── PRESEC Schools / Branches
                  └── Year Groups
                        └── Members

