8. SUCCESS METRICS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Short-Term (Year 1):

     •  500+ registered alumni from PRESEC Tema Community 11
     •  50+ verified alumni profiles
     •  5+ active year groups
     •  3+ successful events or reunions managed through the platform
     •  1+ completed school development project

Medium-Term (Years 2-3):

     •  5,000+ registered alumni across multiple PRESEC branches
     •  20+ participating PRESEC schools
     •  100+ job and scholarship opportunities posted
     •  50+ active mentor-mentee pairs
     •  10+ completed school development projects

Long-Term (Years 4-5):

     •  50,000+ registered users
     •  All PRESEC branches in Ghana participating
     •  Mobile application with 10,000+ downloads
     •  Recognized as the official PRESEC digital platform

