━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

┌─────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┐
│ RISK                        │ MITIGATION                            │
├─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Low initial user adoption   │ Launch with strong alumni outreach    │
│                             │ and year-group ambassadors            │
├─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Privacy concerns             │ Build privacy controls from day one; │
│                             │ user-controlled visibility            │
├─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Verification challenges      │ Multi-step alumni verification with  │
│                             │ admin review                          │
├─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Funding for development      │ Phase development; seek sponsorship  │
│                             │ from alumni businesses                │
├─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Historical accuracy          │ Verify all historical claims with    │
│                             │ authoritative sources before publish  │
